{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using pca_n2000 encoder with multiprofile settings, avgpool aggregation, and no image modality. The validation accuracy of 0.5907 and F1 score of 0.5727 are lower than the scvi_n200 baseline in multiprofile settings (0.6501 and 0.6275), suggesting pca_n2000 may underperform in this configuration. However, the lack of direct comparisons to other encoders or aggregation methods in multiprofile settings leaves uncertainty about whether this result generalizes to other datasets or configurations."
}

